WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.700
<v Board member>Who knew the interlock had been bypassed?

2
00:00:04.342 --> 00:00:11.578
<v Narrator>At Delta Industrial Nigeria's Ogun State facility, pressure to hit group margin targets had been building for months.

3
00:00:12.228 --> 00:00:15.753
<v Operator>That interlock has been bypassed for months. We shouldn't be running this line.

4
00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:19.528
<v Supervisor>I've raised it. The answer is keep running. Just get this batch through.

5
00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:23.870
[Alarm. Machinery stops abruptly. Shouting.]

6
00:00:24.812 --> 00:00:26.397
<v Narrator>The accident stopped production,

7
00:00:26.547 --> 00:00:30.509
<v Narrator>but the first reports quickly raised a more difficult question.

8
00:00:30.659 --> 00:00:35.809
<v Narrator>Had people inside Delta already known that the safety system was being bypassed?

9
00:00:36.712 --> 00:00:40.579
<v Narrator>As management began reviewing what happened, earlier warnings started to surface.

10
00:00:40.729 --> 00:00:44.597
<v Narrator>Internal communication suggested that concerns had been raised before the incident,

11
00:00:44.747 --> 00:00:49.669
<v Narrator>while some managers were also trying to control how much was being written down.

12
00:00:50.712 --> 00:00:52.646
<v Narrator>The investigation then uncovered another issue.

13
00:00:52.796 --> 00:00:56.664
<v Narrator>A series of repeated payments to third parties appeared in the records,

14
00:00:56.814 --> 00:01:01.004
<v Narrator>raising questions about what those payments were for, and who had approved them.

15
00:01:02.012 --> 00:01:04.913
<v Narrator>Before the company had reached its own conclusion,

16
00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:07.965
<v Narrator>the crisis had already moved outside the organisation.

17
00:01:08.115 --> 00:01:13.192
<v Narrator>A journalist was preparing a story, and the regulator wanted answers from the Board.

18
00:01:14.212 --> 00:01:16.846
<v Narrator>Delta now faced more than a workplace accident.

19
00:01:16.996 --> 00:01:20.288
<v Narrator>The Board needed to understand what happened, who was responsible,

20
00:01:20.438 --> 00:01:24.060
<v Narrator>what should be disclosed, and what the company should do next.

21
00:01:25.232 --> 00:01:27.046
<v Managing Director>The Board meets in seventy-two hours.

22
00:01:27.196 --> 00:01:31.732
<v Managing Director>I need to understand what happened, how far this goes, and what we can defend.

23
00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:33.891
<v Narrator>That is where you come in.

24
00:01:35.141 --> 00:01:37.841
You have 72 hours.

